Wed Sep  9 06:23:21 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal <mpluskal@suse.com>

- Update to 1.40.0:
  * modelscope / ms console scripts moved to
    python-modelscope-hub (>= 0.3.0); this package ships CLI
    plugins via the modelscope_hub.cli_plugins entry-point group
  * Fix studio CLI
- CVE-2026-84202: PyYAML unsafe Loader on remote model config
  files allowed arbitrary code execution (boo#1278007)
  * fix-CVE-2026-84202.patch
- Drop modelscope and ms binaries and their libalternatives
  machinery (now provided by python-modelscope-hub)

