Sat Aug 22 05:40:21 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal <mpluskal@suse.com>

- Initial package of python-modelscope 1.39.1: ModelScope hub and
  library core (Model-as-a-Service SDK)
  * Requires python-modelscope-hub >= 0.2.0; import modelscope
    loads the hub client
  * Ships modelscope and ms CLI entry points (delegates to
    modelscope-hub)
  * cv/nlp/audio extras are not hard-required; Suggests
    python-transformers, python-datasets and python-Pillow
  * Non-free NVIDIA proprietary, NVIDIA-NC and CC-BY-NC files
    from optional extras are removed in prep and not shipped

